## Returns / refunds

- **All sales are final once an order is marked as processed.** The only
  exceptions are:
  1. **Pre-processing cancellations** — full refund, no fee, before the
     order is marked processed.
  2. **Shipping-damage claims** — see below.
- After an order is marked processed, no refund is available even if the
  customer asks us to halt shipment.
- **Damage claim window: 48 hours after delivery confirmation.** Stricter
  than the previous 24-48hr range — the policy is "within 48 hours" flat.
- Claim must include **photos** of outer box + product + the order number,
  emailed to `aminomarketsupport@gmail.com` (or sent through Telegram /
  Discord support).
- On approved damage claim: customer chooses **replacement OR refund**.
  Either resolution requires the damaged product to be returned using our
  prepaid label first. Replacement ships (or refund is issued via Stripe)
  once the carrier scans the return.
- **Refused / RTS / undeliverable parcels:** no refund. Customer can opt
  for re-shipment to a corrected address at their expense (invoiced before
  re-shipping).
- **Lost parcels:** customer files the claim directly with the carrier
  (USPS or UPS); we help assemble the paperwork. Resolution depends on
  the carrier's investigation outcome.
- We do NOT offer change-of-mind, wrong-item-selected, or "no longer
  needed" refunds after fulfillment.
- We do NOT modify orders after submission (no add/remove items).
- Post-delivery temperature handling is the customer's responsibility.

## Shipping

- Standard turnaround (order to delivery) is **1&ndash;2 weeks**.
- Carriers used: **USPS** and **UPS**. Service level selected by the
  shipping calculator based on weight, dimensions, destination, and live
  carrier rate.
- Shipping cost is **calculated at checkout in real time** from the
  carrier's live rate.
- **Free shipping on US domestic orders of $200 or more.** The free-ship
  threshold does **not** apply to international orders — international
  always pays the carrier rate.
- We **ship internationally** as well as everywhere domestically:
  - All 50 US states + DC
  - US territories (Puerto Rico, USVI, Guam, American Samoa)
  - APO / FPO / DPO military addresses
  - US Post Office (P.O.) boxes
  - International destinations (live rate)
- Customs duties, VAT, GST, and import fees are the customer's
  responsibility. Customs seizures are not refundable.
- If a delay pushes outside the 1–2 week window, the customer is emailed.
- No insurance and no signature required on shipments.

## Legal entity & governing law

- Legal entity: **Percival LLC** (a Virginia limited liability company).
- Brand / trade name used in marketing copy: **Amino Market**.
- In legal copy (Terms, Privacy, refund records, copyright line) use
  `Percival LLC, d/b/a Amino Market` &mdash; in marketing/storefront copy
  the brand alone ("Amino Market") is fine.
- Governing law / venue for the Terms of Service: **Commonwealth of
  Virginia** (any state or federal court located in Virginia).
- The Terms include a **binding individual arbitration agreement and
  class-action waiver** (Section 12), AAA Consumer Arbitration Rules,
  with a 30-day opt-out and small-claims-court / injunctive-IP-relief
  carve-outs. Do not remove or weaken this unless explicitly instructed.
- Footer copyright line: `© <year> Percival LLC, d/b/a Amino Market.`

## Sales tax

- We do **not** currently use Stripe Tax or collect sales tax on the
  storefront. The Terms state that sales/use/VAT/GST/customs duties are
  the customer's responsibility unless we expressly collect them. Do not
  add Stripe Tax integration code without explicit owner approval.

## Age gate

- Site is restricted to users **21+ no matter what**.
- The landing age-and-research-use gate must include small text under the
  21+ confirmation reading "By continuing you agree to our Privacy
  Policy" (link to /privacy).

## Marketing communications

- We collect **email and SMS marketing opt-in** at account creation via
  pre-enabled checkboxes the user can uncheck.
- Marketing messages cover **discounts, promotional offers, and product
  launches** only.
- Users can opt out anytime: account settings, unsubscribe link in
  email, or reply STOP to SMS.
- Transactional messages (order status, shipping, support, security)
  always send regardless of marketing opt-out.

## Promo codes / loyalty / affiliate

- **Promo codes:** Posted publicly on the site, applied at checkout.
- **Loyalty:** Customers whose lifetime spend crosses $300 automatically
  earn a 10% discount on all future purchases (applied via Stripe).
- **Affiliate discount codes:** Give the customer using the code 10%
  off. Affiliates earn 25% of profit per code, scaling to 40% after 50+
  orders and $2.5k+ in processed product.
- Discounts cannot be combined unless we explicitly state otherwise.
